thumb/sc12bpj.jpg"}, {"id": 1788104, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12bpk.jpg"}, {"id": 1788105, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12bpl.jpg"}, {"id": 1788106, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12bpm.jpg"}, {"id": 1788108, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12bpo.jpg"}, {"id": 1788111, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12bpr.jpg"}, {"id": 1788112, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12bps.jpg"}], "slug": "jest-messter", "summary": "A comedy-mystery otome visual novel.\n\nOh no! You're stuck with a pun-curse \"gifted\" by the mysterious Jester, a mythical entity known to bring happiness in exchange for your memories.\n\nArmed with the worst dad jokes known to mankind, you transferred to the prestigious Marney High in hopes to uncover the Jester's identity... and hopefully make new friends along the way!\n\nLuckily, your new classmates are just as weird as you are: a stuck-up scholar, a brainrot-loving memelord, a two-faced actor, a weapon-wielding roommate, and a secretive senior with a dangerous secret...\n\nSo be careful who you trust! As sinister plots start to unravel around you and your classmates, you find yourself tangled in their web of secrets and schemes.\n\nAnd maybe... your pun-curse is the key to solve them all?\n\nCommercial remaster of \"The Punniest Pun Messter\".", "themes": [{"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/jest-messter"}